                    <lb n="3" break="no"/>ṭṭu <unclear>ku</unclear>ṭutta paric’ āvatu
                </p>
                <p>nammūr <hi rend="grantha">śrī</hi>-m<choice><orig>u</orig><reg>ū</reg></choice>la<hi rend="grantha">s<choice><orig>t</orig><reg>th</reg></choice>ā</hi>ṉam-uṭaiya parama-<hi rend="grantha">svā</hi>mikku vētam
                    <lb n="4"/>va<unclear>l</unclear>la <hi rend="grantha">brāhma</hi>ṇarai-k koṇṭa tiruvārātaṉai ceyvattukkum <unclear>ne</unclear>lli Ēttāttu-t
                    <lb n="5"/>taṇṇir tiru-mañcaṉa n<choice><orig>i</orig><reg>ī</reg></choice>r Aṭṭuvāṉukkum āka nam <hi rend="grantha">brahmade</hi>yam <unclear>n</unclear>eriñci kuṟumpa
                    <lb n="6" break="no"/>ṟ kaḻaṉiyil kaliyūṉṟiyilē cempiyaṉ muṉaippāṭi muvē<unclear>n=ta</unclear>vēḷāṉ Āvaṇa
                    <lb n="7" break="no"/>ttu Irupatu ce<unclear>ṟu</unclear>vu koṇṭu I<hi rend="grantha">d-dharma</hi>ttkku-k kuṭuttēṉ
