                    I<hi rend="grantha">d-dhanma</hi><supplied reason="omitted">m</supplied> <hi rend="grantha"><choice><sic>ś</sic><corr>c</corr></choice>an<choice><orig>t</orig><reg>d</reg></choice>rā</hi>tittaval
