                    <lb n="9" break="no"/>kku virōtañ c<choice><sic><unclear>e</unclear></sic><corr>ey</corr></choice>tarai <hi rend="grantha">dhanmāsa</hi><unclear>na</unclear>-mutal-āka tā<unclear>m</unclear> vēṇtu kōvukku vev<unclear>veṟ</unclear>ṟu
