                <p>
                    Ipparicu Ott’ e
                    <lb n="11" break="no"/>ḻuttu Iṭṭu-k kuṭuttōm <hi rend="grantha">māh<choice><sic>ā</sic><corr>a</corr></choice>sabhai</hi>yōm
